device_info.description:
Detected device type: {device_model}
Android version: {android_version}

Home Assistant will collect this device's Name and Area on its next screen. The password is set as Kiosk Satellite's own admin password once it is installed, and used to connect it to this Home Assistant instance automatically.

Note: If "Enable as Default Launcher" is enabled, Android requires you to select Kiosk Satellite as the default home app on the device screen when prompted.

